     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Fact-based report",
     "texto": [
      "An incident report states when and where it happened, what was observed and what effect it had. The past tense records the facts; the passive can highlight the affected object. Separate interpretation from evidence and end with a concrete measure."
     ],
